The shared pieces currently use three unrelated literals (`px-4/6/8`, `gap-x-4`, and asymmetric sidebar padding). I’m making the page breakpoint scale the canonical token source, then routing the sidebar variants and list/detail shell through it; the existing bespoke floating sidebars in Projects and CRM have already drifted from Console’s animated/contextual implementation.
